pdf_oxide scores a detected text region by the mean probability over its
axis-aligned bounding rectangle. PaddleOCR scores a box on its polygon. A
slanting line fills only part of its bounding rectangle, so it scored under the
0.6 box threshold although the detector was sure of it (0.99 inside the line):
a handwritten Tamil page lost six of its eight lines, and a receipt scanned a
little askew its whole header. Score each region on its own pixels instead.

